# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in. Only the corpus builder reads this file (`python -m corpus_builder
# extract`, or `collection build --model gemini` for a public collection): the Ratio app never reads an
# API key and never sends case data anywhere. A private collection is never sent to Gemini.
#
# Google Gemini API key, used only to extract fact patterns from PUBLIC precedent documents.
# Use a paid-tier key: Google may use data sent on the free tier to improve its products.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
